---
description: Ingot UI rules (JetBrains look and feel, tokens, shortcuts)
globs: packages/**/src/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Match the IntelliJ New UI: main toolbar, tool window stripes, compact density, 13px UI font, 20px tool window icons.
- Every action has a command id, an IntelliJ default shortcut (see keymap constants) and appears in Find Action (Cmd+Shift+A).
- Colors only via design tokens (`--ingot-*`); support Ingot Light, Ingot Dark and Darcula themes.
- Every user-facing feature ships with a Playwright e2e spec that drives it with real clicks and shortcuts.
- Never use the Microsoft VS Code Marketplace; extensions come from Open VSX.
